Most suggestions yet seem to have disregarded that the dragon was adjacent
to the stairs and that you had not a single move when arriving at that level
and beaten to death in the first (monster-)turn.

Remember the level number where the bones were. If you are on the level
above that level, apply Jukkas suggestion, dig down, you will most likely
not arrive adjacent, maybe even in another room. It is a bit more difficult
if the bones are on some special level (like Oracle); in this case you have
to dig through quite a few levels to be sure.

A problem is that you usually don't know when the bones file will have been
loaded. So you have to check the passed levels with ESP and blindness, or
you want to look into the filesystem whether the bones file has been deleted.

